{{Term/Store|Hearty Radish|Hearty Radishes|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Hearty Radish}}
Hearty Radishes are found in the ground in [[Hyrule Ridge]] and [[East Necluda]], their location indicated by their stalk. Hearty Radishes are also sold by [[Beedle]] at the [[East Akkala Stable]] and the [[General Shoppe]]. Hearty Radishes can be eaten raw to restore two and a half [[Heart]]s. If a Hearty Radish is roasted over a [[Campfire]], it becomes a [[Roasted Radish]]. If a Hearty Radish is [[Cooking|Cooked]] in a [[Cooking Pot]], the resulting [[Food]] will grant Link [[Extra Hearts]], which temporarily increases Link's maximum Hearts.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> At the [[Kochi Dye Shop]], Hearty Radishes are one of the ingredients that can be used to make Peach Hateno Dye. Hearty Radishes are not required to upgrade any pieces of [[Armor]] at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]].

